<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>删除账号 · Kestrel Studio</title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/logo.svg">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/main.css">
</head>
<body class="admin-page">
  <header class="topbar">
    <a class="brand" href="/">
      <img class="brand-logo" src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="32" height="32">
      <span class="brand-name">Kestrel Studio</span>
    </a>

    <nav class="menu">
      <a class="menu-button" href="/">返回对话</a>
      <a class="menu-button" href="/admin">账号管理</a>
    </nav>

    <div class="account">
      <div class="account-menu">
        <span class="account-name">{{user.username}}</span>
        <form action="/logout" method="post" class="logout-form">
          <button type="submit" class="logout-button">退出登录</button>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  {{! A separate page rather than a confirm() on the row, since the admin pages
      carry no client script. }}
  <main class="admin-main">
    <section class="admin-card admin-card-danger">
      <h2 class="admin-title">删除账号 {{account.username}}</h2>
      <p class="admin-hint">
        将一并删除该账号名下 {{account.conversationCount}} 个会话、{{account.assetCount}} 个资产文件，
        以及这些会话的全部消息与任务记录。此操作不可撤销。
      </p>
      <form class="admin-form" action="/admin/users/{{account.id}}/delete" method="post">
        <button type="submit" class="admin-button admin-button-danger">确认删除</button>
        <a class="admin-button admin-button-quiet" href="/admin">取消</a>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
